dere sia i suoi nemici che il re in persona. Ed è grazie a quest'ombra che tesserà un intricato piano per far trionfare il popolo, in una guerra che il re non vuole vincere."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Shadow","overview":"In a kingdom ruled by a young and unpredictable king, the military commander has a secret weapon: a shadow, a look-alike who can fool both his enemies and the King himself. Now he must use this weapon in an intricate plan that will lead his people to victory in a war that the King does not want.","tagline":"The Battlefield in Ink."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"沛国，一个年轻又喜怒无常的君王统治的王国。军事都督有一个秘密武器：“影子”——一个能与敌国君主力抗的替身，一个能让君王真假难辨的影子。如今，都督必须借助这个影子，以一场君王不愿为之的战争，引领子民走向胜利。","tagline":"雄臣的影子，不是筹谋，是野心。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jOSdl4US14PADyaPilVp8sQS9M4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1A0h3Bek2eyxHNRikyZdXDGXxdS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":463319,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qVXFyASEt1kLpZv9EYze0S0mZe4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qVXFyASEt1kLpZv9EYze0S0mZe4.jpg","language":"en","width":1500,"height":2249},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u3TvnEZTal3qHu9F8KgbCmFzrmv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u3TvnEZTal3qHu9F8Kg